Third, the cryptography pass shows that JWT signing uses a symmetric key (HMAC-SHA256). The NHS Data Security and Protection Toolkit mandates specific key management standards. I need confirmation of the current key rotation schedule and how it will be enforced and audited in the target sovereign environment.

